WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
(audience applauds)

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.163
- What more can I say?

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:17.749
They told me Zelenskyy would
introduce me tonight, but-

00:00:17.749 --> 00:00:19.950
(audience laughs)

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.403
Thank God I got Bill instead.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:27.760
Actually, Warren Beatty got me here.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.627
He said, "Go there.

00:00:29.627 --> 00:00:31.097
"I'll give you the award.

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:32.007
"I'll take you there.

00:00:32.007 --> 00:00:36.088
"You won't be afraid," and
then he never called me again.

00:00:36.088 --> 00:00:39.180
(audience laughs)

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.440
And no one else would come but Bill,

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.067
and people say, "My mother is dying.

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:44.317
"I don't feel well.

00:00:44.317 --> 00:00:48.993
"I'm afraid of COVID," but
I think this is very nice.

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:53.300
I do believe that for this award,

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.300
you should add the words
for now at the end of it

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:01.300
because it's really scary if
you don't, but I want to...

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:04.583
I don't even know who a
lot of people are here.

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:07.480
Are they all ex-award winners?

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:09.870
Are you all guys who won awards here?

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:11.773
Did you just come as guests?

00:01:11.773 --> 00:01:12.720
(audience murmurs)

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:13.973
I'm so thrilled.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:16.553
Bill?

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:19.740
- You're doing great.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:20.628
- Okay.

00:01:20.628 --> 00:01:21.461
(audience laughs)

00:01:21.461 --> 00:01:23.540
If you could only have heard Bill's speech

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.610
which I heard earlier in the car.

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:27.320
- It was terrible.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.050
- Oh, come on.

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:30.317
It was fantastic.

00:01:30.317 --> 00:01:31.437
It was great.
- No, it was really good,

00:01:31.437 --> 00:01:32.520
but it was...

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:34.950
Well, it went on.

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.470
- He said, "Am I paying for this?"

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:38.730
and we laughed and laughed
and he didn't give it,

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:40.200
but it was a really good speech.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.729
- Thank you.
(audience laughs)

00:01:41.729 --> 00:01:43.960
- And so I don't know what else to say

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:46.710
except enjoy your food.

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:48.390
I'm not sure what it is.

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:49.638
What is it?

00:01:49.638 --> 00:01:52.400
(audience murmurs)

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:53.233
Oh, really?

00:01:53.233 --> 00:01:54.066
I didn't know.

00:01:54.066 --> 00:01:55.880
Anyway, have a good time.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.280
I'm gonna find my way off
the stage and thank...

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:02.379
Thank you for this amazingly heavy award.

00:02:02.379 --> 00:02:05.379
(audience applauds)

